&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join one of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Core Marketing Platforms teams&lt;/strong&gt;, where&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;build and&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;high-performance microservices that power FanDuel&#39;s marketing ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work on systems enabling critical capabilities such as real-time customer communications, personalized promotions, and targeted campaign delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your work will focus on designing highly scalable, event-driven systems that process large volumes of real-time data, delivering intelligent insights to marketing partners.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help enable data-driven, personalized experiences for millions of customers across our platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
